    "created_at": "2019-12-27T22:01:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-12-27T22:09:29Z",
    "body": "It could be very useful in animations based on videos. Rewind back and forward. playbackRate is way more straightforward and performant than setting currentTime in interval.\r\n\r\nMoreover, animating with currentTime causes FPS drop (https://medium.com/@akella/story-of-one-animation-webgl-and-not-webgl-c733c44f489e) and needs conversion to fix keyframes.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
