    "body": "For those who want to track/help browsers implementing this:\r\n\r\n* Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1468019\r\n* Chrome/chromium: https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40410591 (incorrectly closed as duplicate. the linked duplicate ticket correctly closed as negative playbackrate being\"ignored\" is fixed by throwing an exception, but as worded this bug is not).\r\n\r\nEach tracker has a \"vote\" or \"+1\" button, so no need to spam \"me too\" comments",
